     <P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 79.5pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 27pt; mso-char-indent-count: 4.95; mso-line-height-rule: exactly"><B style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal"><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 16pt; COLOR: black; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-hansi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'">“愿我们的爱与玉树同在”爱心捐款通报</SPAN></B><B style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal"><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 16pt; COLOR: black"><?xml:namespace prefix = o ns = "urn:schemas-microsoft-com:office:office" /><o:p></o:p></SPAN></B></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 30pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 19pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; mso-line-height-rule: exactly"><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 15pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: &#718;&#805;; mso-hansi-font-family: &#718;&#805;">玉树地震，全国震惊。面对灾区老人们的无助、孩子们的无辜、伤者们的痛楚，中华民族扶危济困、行善积德的美德在绍兴一中得到了充分的彰显。在短短的一天时间内就收到全校同学的捐款</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 15pt; FONT-FAMILY: &#718;&#805;">85671.85</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 15pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: &#718;&#805;; mso-hansi-font-family: &#718;&#805;">元人民币，</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 15pt; FONT-FAMILY: &#718;&#805;">1</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 15pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: &#718;&#805;; mso-hansi-font-family: &#718;&#805;">欧元，</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 15pt; FONT-FAMILY: &#718;&#805;">2美</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 15pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: &#718;&#805;; mso-hansi-font-family: &#718;&#805;">元。</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 15pt; FONT-FAMILY: &#718;&#805;"><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 30pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 19pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; mso-line-height-rule: exactly"><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 15pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: &#718;&#805;; mso-hansi-font-family: &#718;&#805;">这笔款项已汇入绍兴市红十字会的中心账号，并统一捐往青海玉树灾区。经核对后，各班捐款数额具体如下。</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 15pt; FONT-FAMILY: &#718;&#805;"><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
